This one, now this one's of notable roundness because, like... 

You see, a sphere is the perfect shape - no weak points; you know how the saying goes: A bar is as good as its drunkest patron... or something to that effect. 

But yeah, a sphere's the best at enduring high pressure and stress, not so much external pressure cause it's made of tough stuff, but rather internal pressure due to all, like, hard thinking it's gotta do.&lt;end&gt;

